text":"ஓள்","lemma":"ஓள்","gloss":"she who has"}],"gloss":"she of dark beauty"},{"surface":"வயின்","parts":[{"text":"வயின்","lemma":"வயின்","gloss":"with/towards"}],"gloss":"with"}]},{"words":[{"surface":"இன்றை","parts":[{"text":"இன்று","lemma":"இன்று","gloss":"today"},{"text":"ஐ","lemma":"ஐ","gloss":"formative suffix"}],"gloss":"of today"},{"surface":"அன்ன","parts":[{"text":"அன்ன","lemma":"அன்ன","gloss":"like"}],"gloss":"like"},{"surface":"நட்பின்","parts":[{"text":"நட்பு","lemma":"நட்பு","gloss":"love/friendship"},{"text":"இன்","lemma":"இன்","gloss":"of"}],"gloss":"of love"},{"surface":"இந்நோய்","parts":[{"text":"இந்நோய்","lemma":"இந்நோய்","gloss":"this pain"}],"gloss":"this pain","split_unverified":true}]},{"words":[{"surface":"இறுமுறை","parts":[{"text":"இறு","lemma":"இறு","gloss":"end"},{"text":"முறை","lemma":"முறை","gloss":"state/manner"}],"gloss":"end"},{"surface":"என","parts":[{"text":"என","lemma":"என","gloss":"saying/as"}],"gloss":"as"},{"surface":"ஒன்று","parts":[{"text":"ஒன்று","lemma":"ஒன்று","gloss":"one thing"}],"gloss":"one thing"},{"surface":"இன்றி","parts":[{"text":"இன்றி","lemma":"இன்றி","gloss":"without"}],"gloss":"without"}]},{"words":[{"surface":"மறுமை","parts":[{"text":"மறுமை","lemma":"மறுமை","gloss":"next life"}],"gloss":"next life"},{"surface":"உலகத்து","parts":[{"text":"உலகத்து","lemma":"உலகத்து","gloss":"in the world"}],"gloss":"in the world","split_unverified":true},{"surface":"மன்னுதல்","parts":[{"text":"மன்னுதல்","lemma":"மன்னுதல்","gloss":"enduring"}],"gloss":"enduring"},{"surface":"பெறுமே","parts":[{"text":"பெறும்","lemma":"பெறு","gloss":"will obtain"},{"text":"ஏ","lemma":"ஏ","gloss":"indeed (emphasis)"}],"gloss":"will indeed obtain"}]}],"literal":"Even if obtaining [her] is not possible, that which happens / is indeed there, may you live, O heart! Strong chariot / generous-handed Ōri's forest touching / blowing wind smells of, curly / black moist hair, she of dark beauty with, / like today's, of love, this pain, / saying \"an end\", without even one, / in the next world, enduring will indeed obtain.","translation":"Even if it is not possible to win her, O my heart, may you live! There is one thing that will surely happen. Our love for this woman of dark beauty, who has moist, black, curly tresses fragrant with the blowing wind that has brushed through the forests of the strong-charioted, generous-handed chieftain Ōri, will remain as fresh as it is today. Without any end, this painful longing will endure even into the next world.","modern":"என் நெஞ்சமே, நீ வாழ்க! அவளை அடைவது நமக்குக் கூடாமல் போனாலும், ஒன்று மட்டும் உறுதியாக நடக்கும். வலிமையான தேரையும் கொடைத்தன்மையையும் உடைய ஓரி என்னும் வள்ளலின் காடுகளைத் தொட்டு வீசும் காற்றில் நறுமணம் கமழும், சுருண்ட, கரிய, குளிர்ந்த கூந்தலையுடைய அந்த மாநிறத்து அழகியிடம் நாம் கொண்டுள்ள இந்த அன்பும் அதனால் உண்டான துன்பமும், இன்றிருப்பது போலவே எவ்வித முடிவும் இல்லாமல், மறுமை உலகத்திலும் நிலைபெற்றுத் தொடரும்.","explanation":"The hero is speaking to his own heart in this Kuriñci (mountainous) landscape poem. He has fallen deeply in love with the heroine but faces obstacles in marrying or attaining her. He consoles his heart, saying that even if they cannot be united in this life, their love and the sweet pain of longing will never fade. It will remain as fresh as it is today and will endure eternally, even into the next life. The mention of the chieftain Ōri's forest and the fragrant wind brushing through it to scent the heroine's hair evokes the lush, fertile Kuriñci landscape, symbolizing the rich, natural, and everlasting nature of their love. Key words include 'நெஞ்சே' (O heart), 'மாஅயோள்' (she of dark beauty), 'நட்பின் இந்நோய்' (this pain of love), and 'மறுமை உலகத்து' (in the next world).","model":"gemini-3.5-flash"},"timing":{"male":[[0.0,0.43],[0.43,0.72],[0.72,1.2],[1.4,1.9],[1.92,2.8],[2.8,3.0],[3.3,3.3],[3.3,4.3],[4.3,5.0],[5.2,5.2],[5.2,5.4],[5.4,6.1],[6.1,7.0],[7.0,7.2],[7.2,7.5],[7.5,8.1],[8.1,8.27],[8.27,8.27],[8.27,8.27],[8.27,8.61],[9.13,9.3],[9.85,11.